  "description": "The consumer-side other half of OrionPatch: a transport-agnostic transactional inbox for exactly-once message effects. Declare an IInboxHandler<T> and ProcessAsync dedups the message id and runs the handler in one atomic transaction, so a redelivered message lands once. This package is the framework-free core (handler, message, result, options, telemetry); add OrionInbox.EntityFrameworkCore for the store.",
